WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.093 --> 00:00:02.290
(glass smashes)

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.884
(tense music)

00:00:04.884 --> 00:00:07.467
(upbeat music)

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.483
- Forget Benji.

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:57.513
And to hell with that phone.

00:01:08.539 --> 00:01:10.033
Give me your hand.

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:11.197
- The train's coming.

00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:12.508
- Pick it up, pick it up, pick it up,

00:01:12.508 --> 00:01:13.695
pick it up, pick it up, pick it up,

00:01:13.695 --> 00:01:14.998
pick it up, pick it up, pick it up,

00:01:14.998 --> 00:01:16.487
pick it up, pick it up, pick it up,

00:01:16.487 --> 00:01:17.898
pick it up, pick it up, pick it up.

00:01:17.898 --> 00:01:19.084
- Your hand, now.

00:01:19.084 --> 00:01:24.084
- Pick it up!

00:01:36.546 --> 00:01:39.190
- Hey man, I'm thinking maybe...

00:01:45.598 --> 00:01:48.431
- Like you said, I'm not a killer,

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.193
but this,

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.344
is about her.

00:01:55.344 --> 00:01:56.823
- I'm telling you.

00:01:57.869 --> 00:01:59.506
- I'm scared.

00:01:59.506 --> 00:02:01.706
I'm very scared of what
you would do to her.

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.223
Maple almond latte?

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.073
Two Stevia.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.107
Two tablespoons of peanut oil.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.040
Could've gone either way.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.005
He's lied about so many things.

00:02:23.005 --> 00:02:26.100
Who knew, the peanut allergy was real.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.103
Benji has to go.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:40.400
The books are safe, basement
is 100% corpse free,

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.760
can't burn the body in daylight anyway

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.070
so the least Benji can
do is wait in the car

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.020
for a little while.

00:02:46.493 --> 00:02:48.917
- I like who I am with you Joe.

00:02:51.177 --> 00:02:55.426
♪ You can see it in my eyes ♪

00:02:55.426 --> 00:02:58.172
♪ I'm an animal ♪

00:02:58.172 --> 00:03:00.924
♪ Coming out of nowhere ♪

00:03:00.924 --> 00:03:03.990
♪ I'm an animal ♪

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.730
♪ Take a breath and say your prayers ♪

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:09.874
- Sorry I didn't call,
is it okay if I come in?

00:03:09.874 --> 00:03:12.986
♪ Coming out of nowhere ♪

00:03:12.986 --> 00:03:16.000
♪ I'm an animal ♪

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:21.000
♪ Take a breath and say your prayers ♪

00:03:21.085 --> 00:03:24.118
♪ You play your game ♪

00:03:24.118 --> 00:03:26.889
♪ I take my time ♪

00:03:26.889 --> 00:03:30.074
♪ You take your aim ♪

00:03:30.074 --> 00:03:32.733
♪ Commit your crime ♪

00:03:32.733 --> 00:03:36.159
♪ I won't back down ♪

00:03:36.159 --> 00:03:38.992
♪ Won't come away ♪

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:42.292
- [Beck] Too rough for you Goldberg?

00:03:42.292 --> 00:03:43.660
- [Joe] Not at all.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.023
♪ I'm an animal ♪

00:03:46.023 --> 00:03:48.893
♪ Coming out of nowhere ♪

00:03:48.893 --> 00:03:51.918
♪ I'm an animal ♪

00:03:51.918 --> 00:03:55.354
♪ Take a breath and say your prayers ♪

00:03:55.354 --> 00:03:59.290
- Hello, how old were you
when this was taken, Beck?

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.483
And what is Peach doing with it?

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.383
- Hello Joe.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.597
Sorry I'm so wet.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:36.460
- [Joe] I know what it's like
to be in love with you Beck.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.460
This is not what love looks like.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.660
This isn't how love behaves,

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.540
this is the work of a sick mind.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.010
Let's call it what it is, perversion.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:46.880
Now I understand why Peach is
setting you up for failure,

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.943
she's not threatened by you,
she's obsessed with you.

00:04:50.949 --> 00:04:53.980
- You know I love you forever, right?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.510
- [Joe] She wants to watch you, have you,

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:58.430
control you like she controls
every other piece of her life.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.093
She wants you all to herself.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:05.250
Beck, you've got a stalker.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.003
This is why I took up jogging.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:16.296
♪ You must run and hide ♪

00:05:16.296 --> 00:05:19.364
♪ For the hunter he seeks ♪

00:05:19.364 --> 00:05:23.501
♪ With his devilish pride ♪

00:05:23.501 --> 00:05:25.720
(eerie music)

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.210
- Uh-oh, she's dead.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.123
Of course she's dead, she fell.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.353
That's right, she fell.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.350
An accident.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.090
Happens all the time, she
was running and she fell,

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.410
into a rock, over and over again.

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:44.000
Okay let's be real, she was
attacked, someone attacked her,

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.330
but maybe they had a good reason, right?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.840
You ever think of that, detective?

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:52.840
The universe has a funny
way of keeping us humble.

00:05:53.169 --> 00:05:55.693
That beating was karmic, I know it.

00:05:56.545 --> 00:05:59.650
I did a bad thing today,
(phone vibrating)

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.390
but for a good reason,

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:03.473
and if there's any justice in the world,

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.633
you are the reward for all my suffering.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:11.533
Hey you.

00:06:12.812 --> 00:06:14.123
- Oh Joe thank God.

00:06:14.986 --> 00:06:19.102
Peach was attacked in Central
Park in broad daylight.

00:06:19.102 --> 00:06:20.733
I'm headed to the ER now.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:23.563
- She's alive?

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:31.610
I need to patch up, focus,
get back in the game.

00:06:36.061 --> 00:06:38.311
(laughing)

00:06:40.868 --> 00:06:42.618
I love you, you know.

00:07:05.161 --> 00:07:07.328
I'll double back for that.

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:12.650
How long is she going to
stand there staring at you?

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:17.240
- [Peach] Um, I swear it
was here, I just used it.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.073
Oh.

00:07:21.114 --> 00:07:23.033
- [Joe] Another thing I keep learning,

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.799
things can always get worse.

00:07:27.799 --> 00:07:29.702
- [Peach] You want this?

00:07:29.702 --> 00:07:30.951
- [Male] I don't have one.

00:07:30.951 --> 00:07:31.833
- [Peach] Okay.

00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:33.410
Here he comes, big daddy.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.074
- [Joe] Oh Beck, I'm so boned,

00:07:36.074 --> 00:07:39.320
but not as boned as Raj is about to be.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.333
- [Raj] Oh, God, that's interesting.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:45.220
- You know deep down
she's never gonna love you

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.053
the way you love her.

00:07:46.053 --> 00:07:46.886
- Stop saying that.

00:07:46.886 --> 00:07:48.480
- She's never gonna do it.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.497
You can't have her.

00:07:49.497 --> 00:07:54.497
- Stop saying it!
(gunshot)

00:07:56.451 --> 00:07:58.618
(gunshot)

00:07:59.768 --> 00:08:02.268
(tense music)

00:08:31.448 --> 00:08:34.047
(gunshot)

00:08:34.047 --> 00:08:36.520
- I mean honestly Dr.
Nicky's been really helpful

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:37.620
dealing with my grief.

00:08:39.152 --> 00:08:41.862
I think we need more stars,
they're in your office, right?

00:08:41.862 --> 00:08:42.695
- Yeah.

00:08:43.786 --> 00:08:46.580
Don't get me wrong, there's nothing wrong

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.460
with going to therapy, it's
just it's a bit troubling

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.673
when your partner hides
something from you.

00:08:51.673 --> 00:08:53.583
Don't you agree, Dr. Nicky?

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.670
- I hear you Paul.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:57.733
Not cool.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:02.853
- Oh shit.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.073
Hey man, did you,

00:09:07.616 --> 00:09:09.894
did you want a bump?

00:09:09.894 --> 00:09:11.301
- [Joe] Yeah, yeah.

00:09:11.301 --> 00:09:12.533
- [Elijah] Whoa, bro.

00:09:12.533 --> 00:09:15.283
(Elijah screams)

00:09:24.613 --> 00:09:25.446
- Oh shit.

00:09:37.009 --> 00:09:39.509
(tense music)

00:10:13.329 --> 00:10:15.145
(panicked breathing)

00:10:15.145 --> 00:10:16.586
My phone.

00:10:16.586 --> 00:10:18.823
Must have dropped it in the subway.

00:10:18.823 --> 00:10:20.343
- Huh.

00:10:20.343 --> 00:10:21.676
- What the hell?

00:10:42.675 --> 00:10:43.710
- Yeah.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:44.987
Hey, I'm on my way bro.

00:10:46.998 --> 00:10:50.853
- Ozma of Oz, and who
said anything about Joe?

00:10:50.853 --> 00:10:53.270
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:11:09.352 --> 00:11:12.019
(glass smashes)

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.890
Hey, Annika just texted,
she's totally freaking out,

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:20.340
something about her psycho roommate.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.910
I'm gonna go check on her, all right?

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.013
I'll call you later.

00:11:57.941 --> 00:11:58.774
Joe!

00:12:00.708 --> 00:12:01.541
Joe!

00:12:02.725 --> 00:12:04.316
Joe!

00:12:04.316 --> 00:12:05.149
Joe!

00:12:07.833 --> 00:12:11.073
- Everything I have done
I have done for you.

00:12:12.894 --> 00:12:15.532
- Even this?

00:12:15.532 --> 00:12:16.532
- Even this.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:29.000
- I know that I am better
with you than without you.

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:30.383
- Beck.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.843
- Oh if you were in here this
would be our moment to kiss.

00:12:53.832 --> 00:12:56.249
(Joe groans)

00:12:59.639 --> 00:13:00.472
- Beck!

00:13:02.872 --> 00:13:06.047
(distant screaming)

00:13:06.047 --> 00:13:06.923
- Paco!

00:13:06.923 --> 00:13:08.390
Paco thank God, I need your help.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.660
Open this door right now.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:13.236
Joe, he is downstairs and he's crazy.

00:13:13.236 --> 00:13:14.069
- Joe?

00:13:14.069 --> 00:13:16.850
- Paco, he has killed people.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:17.870
He's gonna kill me.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:19.613
Open this door right now!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:21.661
Paco!

00:13:21.661 --> 00:13:22.891
Open the door!

00:13:22.891 --> 00:13:25.138
Open the door, please!

00:13:25.138 --> 00:13:26.910
Please Paco, no!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.743
No Paco!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.800
- When Mooney locked me
in I learned a big lesson,

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.543
hide a spare key so you can
get out of the goddamn cage.

00:13:44.674 --> 00:13:47.757
(panicked breathing)

00:13:52.423 --> 00:13:54.923
(tense music)

